id: flash-input-keys
section: Flash
item: The system keyboard comes up over an engaged movie on a double tap (the first tap engaged it, with no keyboard), with no editor focused; letters, digits, space and its arrow joystick arrive as the right key codes, the page does not move, and a tap outside drops it
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
wait text ready stage= 30
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect keyboard down
pause 800
dtap 240 272
expect keyboard up
pause 1500
type-keys a
wait text keydown "keydown 65 97" 5
type-keys 1
wait text keydown "keydown 49 49" 5
type-keys " "
wait text keydown "keydown 32 32" 5
expect card-scroll 0 5
drag 702 757 702 700 350
wait text keydown "keydown 38 0" 5
drag 702 757 760 757 350
wait text keydown "keydown 39 0" 5
drag 702 757 702 810 350
wait text keydown "keydown 40 0" 5
drag 702 757 640 757 350
wait text keydown "keydown 37 0" 5
expect card-scroll 0 5
tap-at 600 500
expect keyboard down
